# Code quality gates

Must pass hooks/CI:

- lint / format
- typecheck (`pnpm check-types` in app)
- Knip (unused exports)
- tests
- build

- No `any` (TypeScript strict)
- Prefer repo root: `pnpm dev`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm build` (Turborepo cache)

Source: [docs/06-code-quality.md](../docs/06-code-quality.md), [docs/07-package-cicd.md](../docs/07-package-cicd.md)

After non-trivial changes: run [reviewer agent](../agents/reviewer/SKILL.md) via [coordinator](../agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md).
